<title>NEW ZEALAND: BT Australia takes 6.77 pct stake in Kiwi.</title>
<headline>BT Australia takes 6.77 pct stake in Kiwi.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers Trust Australia said on Monday that on March 14 it had become a substantial security holder in Kiwi Income Property Trust.</p>
<p>BT Australia had at that date a relevant interest in 5.67 percent of Kiwi's fully paid ordinary units, 12.37 percent of its new units and 6.77 percent of its total voting securities.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
